Print #1,Length(5);Length(6);Length(7);Length(8);Length(9)
Print #1,Start(9)
Erase Temp : Print #1,Length(5);Length(6);Length(7);Length(8)
Reserve As Work 5,100 : Bank Swap 5,6 : Print #1,Length(5);Length(6)
Bank Swap 6,12 : Print #1,Length(6);Length(12)
Bank Swap 0,1
Bank Shrink 12 To 50 : Print #1,Length(12)
Bank Shrink 12 To 500
Bank Shrink 13 To 10
Reserve As Work 0,10
Reserve As Work 65536,10
Reserve As Work 3,0
Reserve As Data 9,1000 : Reserve As Data 9,64 : Print #1,Length(9)
Fill Start(9) To Start(9)+64,$41424344 : Print #1,Peek(Start(9)+63)
Print #1,Leek(9)=$41424344
Screen Open 0,320,200,16,Lowres : Curs Off : Cls 0
Ink 1 : Bar 0,0 To 15,15 : Get Bob 1,0,0 To 16,16
Ink 2 : Bar 0,0 To 31,7 : Get Bob 2,0,0 To 32,8
Get Bob 4,0,0 To 8,8
Print #1,Length(1);Length(2)
Ins Bob 2 : Print #1,Length(1)
Del Bob 1 : Print #1,Length(1)
Del Bob 1 To 3
Del Bob 3 To 2 : Print #1,Length(1)
Ins Bob 0
Get Icon 1,0,0 To 16,16 : Get Icon 2,0,0 To 16,16 : Print #1,Length(2)
Ins Icon 1 : Del Icon 3 : Print #1,Length(2)
Del Icon 2 To 1 : Print #1,Length(2)
Reserve As Work 20,32 : Reserve As Data 21,1 : Reserve As Chip Work 22,2
Window 0 : Home : List Bank : Ink 0 : Bar 136,0 To 207,79 : Rem the addresses differ between builds
